   135	| G8 | pass | 80/80 conjugation/scaling/inversion checks; 20/20 unrelated keys distinct |
   136	| G9(c) | pass | 116 chars, 29 estimated tokens, 24 atoms, 108 intended operations |
   137	
   138	The certificate sampler is structure-aware: it draws a uniformly random
   139	12-subset of the nonzero field and automatically emits monic factors in the
   140	required root order. Its space is not the looser space of arbitrary JSON or
   141	arbitrary coefficients.
