   147	| bare ladder | 0/0 | 4 errors | unavailable: OpenRouter HTTP 403 key limit |
   148	| structural hint | 0/0 | 4 errors | unavailable: OpenRouter HTTP 403 key limit |
   149	| placebo hint | 0/0 | 4 errors | unavailable: OpenRouter HTTP 403 key limit |
   150	
   151	`hinted - placebo` is undefined because neither arm obtained a valid attempt;
   152	the module records 0.0 only as a serialization fallback and marks
   153	`diagnostic_complete=false`. No conclusion about hint responsiveness or oracle
   154	hardness is justified yet. Re-run all three scripts after replenishing the
   155	OpenRouter key, then patch `ORACLE_ARM_RESULTS` and regenerate the self-test
   156	report. The structural hint names only the trace recurrence, not a procedure.
   157	
   158	## Use
   159	
   160	From this directory:
   161	
   162	```python
   163	import random
   164	import gen_1810_00203 as g
   165	
