   167	statement = g.render(inst)
   168	answer = g.parse_answer("<answer>" + __import__("json").dumps(inst["answer"]) + "</answer>")
   169	assert g.verify(inst, answer) == (True, "ok")
   170	candidate = g.random_candidate(inst, random.Random(1))
   171	```
   172	
   173	From the repository root, once a valid hardened transcript exists:
